:"<["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CaptureDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel0B6DeviceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]>"}]},"doc://headwirecapture.HeadwireCapture/documentation/HeadwireCapture/FrameFeed":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Frames the app hands in from outside a capture session, such as a decoded network stream, for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/headwirecapture.HeadwireCapture\/documentation\/HeadwireCapture\/CapturePreviewView","type":"reference"},{"text":" to draw as it draws a capture card.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/headwirecapture\/framefeed","identifier":"doc:\/\/headwirecapture.HeadwireCapture\/documentation\/HeadwireCapture\/FrameFeed","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FrameFeed","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FrameFeed","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FrameFeed","kind":"symbol"},"doc://headwirecapture.HeadwireCapture/documentation/HeadwireCapture/CaptureClient/formats":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The formats a connected device offers, in the order the device lists them.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/headwirecapture\/captureclient\/formats","identifier":"doc:\/\/headwirecapture.HeadwireCapture\/documentation\/HeadwireCapture\/CaptureClient\/formats","deprecated":true,"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"formats","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"device","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CaptureDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel0B6DeviceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20HeadwireCaptureModel0B6DeviceV2IDa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ID"},{"text":") ",